  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the system of linear equations</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>,</p><p>has no solution, then</p>",
